OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA cloudy
OL,6,Fevening with a few patches of rain,
OL,7,Fbut mostly dry in the east. Remaining
OL,8,Fcloudy through the night with the
OL,9,Fchance of further rain at times.
OL,10,
OL,11,CSunday:FEarly cloud and rain clearing
OL,12,Faway in the morning. The rest of the
OL,13,Fday will then be mainly dry with good
OL,14,Fsunny spells, perhaps a few showers
OL,15,Flater in north.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
