OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FMonday
OL,6,Fmost places dry with sunny spells.
OL,7,FEarly patchy rain Tuesday then dry,
OL,8,Fbright and warmer. Chance of showers
OL,9,Fon Wednesday but very warm away from
OL,10,Feast coast.
